<div class="space-y-2">
<span class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Breezy</span>
<p class="font-['Inter'] text-sm text-slate-500">© 2024 Breezy Automation. Effortless by design.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex md:justify-end gap-6">
